# Relative energies between enantiopure (1nd entry) and racemate 
# (2nd entry) crystals. These structures have been used in:
#  Otero-de-la-Roza et al. Angew. Chem. Intl. Ed. 53 (2014) 7879.
#  Otero-de-la-Roza et al. Crys. Growth & Des. 16 (2016) 6055.
# The energies come from B86bPBE-XDM calculations in QE. 
#
# NOTE: this file originally carried 98 blocks. The 83 pairs identified by
# CSD refcodes (the larger DFT set of the 2016 CGD paper) referenced
# structures that are not shipped in this repository, so they could not be
# evaluated; they have been removed. What remains are the 15 pairs whose
# geometries are present under 25_ee/b86bpbe-xdm/. The full list is
# recoverable from this file's git history.
